# ==============================================================================
# MANIFEST FILE (README.mf)
# Arabic NLP & Grammar Suite - منصة محلل النصوص والنحو والبلاغة العربية
# ==============================================================================

Manifest-Version: 1.0.0
Application-Name: arabic-nlp-grammar-suite
Application-Title: منصة محلل النصوص والنحو والبلاغة العربية
Application-Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mohamed DRIDI <dridi0207@gmail.com>
License: MIT License (https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
Repository: https://github.com/dridi0207/arabic-nlp-grammar-suite.git
Homepage: https://github.com/dridi0207/arabic-nlp-grammar-suite#readme
Issue-Tracker: https://github.com/dridi0207/arabic-nlp-grammar-suite/issues

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime & Framework Specifications
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Language: TypeScript (~5.8.2)
Runtime-Target: Node.js (>=20.0.0) / Vercel Serverless / Cloud Run Container
Frontend-Framework: React 19.0.1, Vite 6.2.3, Tailwind CSS 4.1.14
Backend-Framework: Express 4.21.2
AI-Engine: Google Gemini API (@google/genai ^2.4.0)
Lexicon-Source: معجم لسان العرب لابن منظور (Lisan Al-Arab)
Audio-Engine: Web Speech Synthesis API (Arabic Male & Female native voices)
PDF-Engine: html2pdf.js (A4 Document Architecture)

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployment Platforms & Configurations
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Platform-1: Vercel (SPA + Serverless Functions via /api/index.ts)
Platform-2: Docker (Multi-stage Node.js Alpine container with Dockerfile)
Platform-3: Google Cloud Run (Containerized Express & Vite build)
Platform-4: Local Dev Server (Vite middlewares on port 3000 via tsx server.ts)

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core Functional Modules
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Module-1: Inline Grammar & Spelling Inspector (المدقق الإملائي والنحوي المباشر)
Module-2: Lisan Al-Arab Morphological Root & Lexicon Browser (معجم لسان العرب)
Module-3: Full-text & Lemma Arabic Text-to-Speech (محرك النطق الصوتي الفصيح)
Module-4: Interactive POS Tagging & Frequency Visualizer (أقسام الكلام والكلمات المكررة)
Module-5: Gemini AI Syntactic Parsing & Irab Table (الإعراب التفاعلي المفصل)
Module-6: Rhetorical Figures & Metaphor Analyzer (البلاغة، التشبيه، الاستعارة، الكناية)
Module-7: Multi-Format Text Import & Export (استيراد وتصدير النصوص، السحب والإفلات، TXT، Markdown، PDF، CSV، JSON)

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment Variables
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Required-Build: None (Static SPA compiles without keys)
Optional-AI: GEMINI_API_KEY (Enables deep syntactic & rhetorical parsing)
Port-Dev: 3000
Port-Prod: 3000 / $PORT

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build Commands
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Install-Command: npm install
Build-Command: npm run build
Lint-Command: npm run lint
Start-Command: npm run start
Dev-Command: npm run dev

